    "35": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0007,0000,><C:0001,0004,><C:0001,0001,>1) Using a Slingshroom<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,><C:0007,0000,><C:0001,0000,><C:0000,0003,00EAFFFF>Hit it with a hammer\n<C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF>to compress it.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,><C:0007,0000,>Stand on it and wait.\nWhen the mushroom pops\nup, you'll <C:0000,0003,00EAFFFF>fly into the sky<C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF>!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,><C:0007,0000,>Try it out. It's a great\nway to relieve stress!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF>",
